    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Clicker: Origins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate idle-action clicker adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through endless waves of enemies as you power up your weapons and sharpen your reflexes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee weapons</strong> boost your <strong>Damage Per Click (DPC)</strong> \u2014 perfect for fast fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged weapons</strong> increase your <strong>Damage Per Second (DPS)</strong> \u2014 crush enemies even while idle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the going gets tough, <strong>Ascend</strong> to reset progress and gain powerful <strong>multipliers</strong> that make every run stronger than the last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements, customize your mouse cursor, and push deeper into the monster-infested world. With every click, you grow closer to uncovering the secrets of the Origins...</p>",
